        {
          "alias": false,
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"9\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\">Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\" selected>Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ce3446\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><b>🌿1. Convenient Addition To A Daily Routine-</b>One of the main practical advantages of a coffee-based wellness beverage such as Booster Brew™ is convenience. Many people already have coffee as part of their daily routine, so incorporating a prepared functional coffee may require little change to their lifestyle. Convenience can be particularly valuable for people with busy mornings, demanding work schedules, or limited time for complicated wellness routines. Instead of managing multiple separate products, a beverage format can make daily use straightforward. However, convenience should not be confused with guaranteed health benefits. The value of Booster Brew™ ultimately depends on its actual ingredients, serving instructions, and the individual's response. Used responsibly and according to the label, it may provide a simple way for coffee drinkers to explore a more wellness-oriented beverage option.</li></ul><ul><li><b>🌿 2. Familiar Coffee Experience-</b>Booster Brew™ may be appealing to consumers who already enjoy the taste and ritual of coffee. Coffee provides a familiar sensory experience, including aroma, warmth, flavor, and the social or personal routine associated with drinking it. Maintaining familiar habits can make it easier for people to remain consistent with a new beverage. For many adults, the morning cup is connected with preparing for the day, reading, working, or taking a short break. A coffee-based functional product can fit naturally into these moments. Taste preferences vary considerably, so consumers should consider the flavor profile and preparation instructions before purchasing. The benefit here is primarily practical and lifestyle-oriented: Booster Brew™ can potentially combine a familiar beverage format with a more intentional approach to everyday wellness.</li></ul><ul><li><b>🌿 3. Potential Support For Alertness-</b>If Booster Brew™ contains caffeine, the beverage may support temporary alertness because caffeine is a recognized stimulant. Many adults consume coffee specifically because they enjoy feeling more awake and attentive after drinking it. The effect can vary according to caffeine tolerance, sleep quality, timing, body chemistry, and total daily caffeine intake. Someone who regularly drinks several cups of coffee may notice a different response from someone who rarely consumes caffeine. It is therefore more accurate to describe this as potential temporary support for alertness rather than a guaranteed energy effect. Consumers should also remember that caffeine is not a substitute for sufficient sleep. Responsible use involves following the serving recommendation and considering caffeine from all other beverages, foods, and supplements consumed during the day.</li></ul><ul><li><b>🌿 Easy-To-Prepare Beverage Format-</b>Another practical benefit of Booster Brew™ is the possibility of fitting wellness into a simple beverage format. People often abandon complicated routines because they require too much preparation, too many steps, or inconvenient timing. A coffee-style product can be easier to incorporate because preparing a beverage is already a familiar activity for many consumers. This may make the product suitable for mornings at home, work breaks, or other routine moments, depending on the manufacturer's instructions. The actual preparation method should always follow the product label because serving sizes and recommended mixing instructions may differ. While convenience does not establish a medical benefit, it can be an important lifestyle advantage for consumers who value simplicity and consistency.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
