          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"formulam5 people3\" group=\"People\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n      <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Name\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Status\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stars\" name=\"showStars\" checked>\n\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#ca9236\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-9': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n          <b>Testimonials</b>\n        </h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet nulla vel, consectetur massa adipiscing.\n        </h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">“I didn’t expect much at first, honestly. I’ve tried a few things over the years and most of them just didn’t do anything noticeable.</span><br></div><div>But after a couple of weeks, I started to feel small changes — mainly in my energy during the day and just feeling more like myself again. Even my mornings feel easier now, like I’m actually ready to get up and go instead of dragging through the day.</div><div>\n</div></h4>\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/t-43.webp\" alt=\"John D.\" title>\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Mark Reynolds – Denver, Colorado&nbsp;</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">“I started using Booster Brew mainly out of curiosity after seeing it online. I wasn’t expecting big changes, but I was hoping for something subtle.</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">After a few weeks, I felt more balanced overall — especially in how I show up at home. I feel more present with my wife, more patient, and honestly more confident in my relationship again.\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">It didn’t change who I am, but it feels like it helped me get back to a better version of myself. That’s probably the best way I can describe it.”&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div></h4>\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gingerfit-review-2.webp\" alt=\"Mark H\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Jason Miller – Austin, Texas&nbsp;</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">I can’t contain my excitement about Nervogen Pro! This incredible supplement has completely transformed my life by alleviating chronic nerve pain and neuropathy. Within just a few weeks, I noticed a remarkable reduction in discomfort, and I feel more relaxed, calm, and energized than ever before. Nervogen Pro is truly a game-changer, and I highly recommend it to anyone struggling with nerve-related issues.</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div></h4>\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/glucotrust-bites-review3.webp\" alt=\"Charlie Williams\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Sarah J. New Jersey, USA&nbsp;</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row mt-0 mt-md-5\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Read More</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
